==Trivia==
*Gorigori's name may be a pun on 懲り懲り ''korigori'' (bad experience; having had enough (of something) and ''[[Gory]]''.
*Gorigori may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Planet of the Apes|Planet of the Apes]]'', especially with the stage's Japanese and Korean names translating to "Planet of the Gorillas".
*Chapter 3 Gorigori's [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] is the only stage of a [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter]] other than [[The Aku Realms]] to have an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy, that being [[Aku Gory]].

